@startuml
!include https://static.visual-paradigm.com/web/resources/plantuml-stdlib/themes/vp.puml

title Order - Confirm Order Item

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activityFontName Arial
skinparam activityFontSize 14
skinparam activityBorderThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderColor #222222
skinparam SwimlaneBorderThickness 2
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  BorderColor #2563EB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #7DD3FC
  DiamondBorderColor #2563EB
  StartColor #111827
  EndColor #FFFFFF
}

|Seller|
start
note right
Precondition:
Seller is logged in and the data
belongs to the Seller.

Postcondition:
The order item is confirmed.
end note
:Open the order-item confirmation function;
|System|
:Display the current order item and the allowed operations;
|Seller|
:Choose the information or the operation to process;
:Send or confirm the request;
|System|
if (The system fails to process the request?) then (Yes)
  :Return the system error;
  |Seller|
  :View the system error;
  stop
else (No)
endif
|System|
:Check the information, the processing conditions, and the permission to perform;
:Update the order item;
:Display the result;
|Seller|
:View the result;
stop

@enduml
